WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,890
Have those people made arrangements? Have they been arranged?

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,090
Looks very evil

3
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:07,170
There is no dry food in their packages at all.

4
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,210
if we don't pick it up

5
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,170
Even if they have physical strength

6
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:10,410
I'm afraid I'll starve to death on the way

7
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,610
Arranged some food for them

8
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:14,170
We also arranged a place for them to live, General.

9
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,210
During this time, we have gathered more than thirty people.

10
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,930
Still continuing to gather

11
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,170
You have ten thousand catties of grain

12
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:21,090
Enough food for us for two months

13
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:23,290
But if our population continues to increase

14
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,750
Then the time the food can be used may be reduced.

15
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:26,830
At the same time, the most important thing is

16
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:28,550
Now we don’t have enough clothes in Yuhan here

17
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,310
Yuhan's clothes

18
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:32,110
In fact, let’s not say it’s Yuhan’s clothes.

19
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,150
Even the quilts covering us inside are not enough

20
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,150
There are quite a few old, weak, rich and literate people here.

21
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:39,070
I'm afraid they won't survive this winter. I understand what you said.

22
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,070
I'll think of a way

23
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,590
Please spend more time during this time

24
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:44,550
I'm trying to find a way to raise cotton-padded clothes and quilts for us. As for food,

25
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:46,830
I'll think of a way to ship another batch to us.

26
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,070
You don't have to worry about things here

27
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,110
Now there are two more iron horses

28
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:50,630
There are more things we can do here

29
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:51,630
You can rest assured

30
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:53,910
Just handle your affairs well, um, that's it

31
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:57,710
I'm going to go to the Winter Palace now to see if you've bothered. It's going to be evening soon. It doesn't matter.

32
00:00:57,710 --> 00:01:00,550
I have my own place to stay over there, General Xiao, take care of yourself.
